      "section_content": "This register can be protected against unprivileged access. Refer to Section40.3.6: TAMP\nprivilege protection modes.\nAddress offset: 0x50\nRTC domain reset value: 0x0000 0000\nSystem reset: not affected\nBits 31:3 Reserved, must be kept at reset value.\nBit 2 IN3_RMP: TAMP_IN3 pin select\n0x0: TAMP_IN3 is mapped on PA1\n0x1: TAMP_IN3 is mapped on PA2\nBit 1 Reserved, must be kept at reset value.\nBit 0 IN2_RMP: TAMP_IN2 pin select\n0x0: TAMP_IN2 is mapped on PA0\n0x1: TAMP_IN2 is mapped on PC1",
